  "fullDescription": "Soft Rose – Watercolor flowers clipart. Soft and dainty pinky-peach roses make up this set along with soft green leaves, some with gray and blue green tones.\nAll pieces were hand-painted on watercolour textured paper. This set contains 11 individual pieces that are ideal for putting together to make your own painted pictures. Each piece can work well individually, or for using together to create your own patterns, borders or floral arrangements. Also included is a PNG finished arrangement. Great for wedding invitations, branding or stationery. It is an easy-to-use set of designs as all the elements are very versatile, with coordinated colors.\n\nPerfect graphics for wedding invitations, greeting cards, branding, photos, posters, logos, scrapbooking works, decorative papers, fabrics, packaging, quotes and more. Also use this collection to create paper products such as invitations, stationery items, mural art posters, planners and scrapbook projects. You can also use them for digital products such as templates, printable designs and web designs.\n\n************\nYou will receive:\n\n11 x individual clip art elements in PNG format (transparent background).\n1 x finished flower arrangement (approx. 11″ x 12″ ) in transparent PNG format.\n\n300 DPI, RGB. All files are high resolution (300 dpi) PNGs with a transparent background.\n************\nColors may vary slightly depending on your computer monitor settings.\n!PLEASE BE NOTED: FONT, MOCKUPS, PHOTOS ARE NOT INCLUDED.",
